+	GAME_SETTING("experimental.zcull_on_demand", "Experimental", "ZCULL", "ZCULL on-demand reads", "Once the game touches its ZCULL report memory, writes the occlusion reports only when a game thread reads them, instead of waiting for the GPU at every report label. Automatic follows the title list (Assassin's Creed, Black Ops II); Enabled and Disabled test the other mode. Takes effect on the next boot.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.zcull_on_demand, 0, 0, 0),
+	GAME_SETTING("experimental.zcull_wait_guard", "Experimental", "ZCULL", "ZCULL on-demand wait guard", "Returns the ZCULL on-demand reads to the upstream mode when game threads wait too long for reports. Automatic keeps it off for the titles of that lever, whose game threads have to wait for the GPU in either mode; Enabled restores it. The deadlines that protect against a request never served always stay on. Takes effect on the next boot.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.zcull_wait_guard, 0, 0, 0),
+	GAME_SETTING("experimental.zcull_cond_no_wait", "Experimental", "ZCULL", "ZCULL conditional draw without waiting", "With ZCULL on-demand reads, draws an object whose occlusion result is still on the GPU instead of waiting for it. An object that turns out to be hidden stays hidden behind what covers it, at the cost of its GPU time. Automatic follows the title list (Assassin's Creed, Black Ops II). Takes effect on the next boot.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.zcull_cond_no_wait, 0, 0, 0),
+	GAME_SETTING("experimental.zcull_async_reads", "Experimental", "ZCULL", "ZCULL asynchronous reads", "With ZCULL on-demand reads, a game read waits for its own report only and the RSX thread keeps working: the read of memory that is already final completes at once. For Assassin's Creed, with Early command buffer submission, a report into a slot the game waited for also sends its command buffer at the next point where no render pass is open, or after 32 more draws. Values stay exact.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.zcull_async_reads, 0, 0, 0),
